-    /**
-     * Pochhammer symbol.<p>
-     *
-     * @implNote
-     * This implementation is <i>slow</i>, meaning that it isn't a <i>fast algorithm</i>.
-     * The asymptotic complexity is at least O(n<sup>2</sup>log&nbsp;n) and it is
